        "b9d6eb19-10f4-41f8-bfdc-ea10e8b3182a": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "tab_display": "popup",
            "open_tab_mobile": false,
            "title": "Candle Care 101",
            "type": "all",
            "content": "<p>LET'S START WITH THE WICK<br/>Before each burn, trim the wick to ¼ of an inch using a wick trimmer for a safe, even burn, and increased candle life. Before each burn remove debris and buildup to avoid excess smoke. Keep the wick centered in the container. <br/><br/></p><p>BURN, BABY, BURN<br/>When you burn, allow the candle wax to melt to the edges of the glass every time to prevent tunneling. This is especially important during your first burn!</p><p><br/>SAFETY FIRST <br/>Never leave a lit candle unattended, and don’t burn your candle for more than 3-4 hours at a time. Protect the surface below your candle from heat by placing your candle on a coaster.</p><p><br/>STOP, LOOK, AND LISTEN <br/>Do not burn your candle if there is less than ½ inch of wax remaining in the glass. Burning a candle without enough wax can overheat the jar.</p>",
            "enable_btn_show_more": false,
            "maximum_des_to_show": 300,
            "product_custom_source": "dynamic",
            "product_tab_key_metafield": ""
          }
        },
        "3d9ea84d-5527-4bce-abe6-5debef3ec955": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "tab_display": "popup",
            "open_tab_mobile": false,
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "type": "all",
            "content": "<p>SHIPPING</p><p>Orders normally ship within 1-2 business days. Once your package is picked up by our carrier, transit times typically range between 1-5 business days, depending on delivery destination. You will receive a confirmation email when your label is created.<br/><br/></p><p>RETURN POLICY</p><p>All returns must be processed within 30 days of receiving the order. If you are not 100% satisfied with your Jackson Vaughn order, please contact our dedicated Support Team at orders@jacksonvaughn.com with your order number (found on your order confirmation email) and we'll help to initiate a return or exchange.</p>",
            "enable_btn_show_more": false,
            "maximum_des_to_show": 300,
            "product_custom_source": "dynamic",
            "product_tab_key_metafield": ""
          }
        },
