            "image": "shopify://shop_images/a8584e210cb992a5d3109934847da945bac9c247.jpg",
            "heading": "Let’s Start With The Wick",
            "description": "<p>Before each burn, trim the wick to ¼ of an inch using a wick trimmer for a safe, even burn, and increased candle life. Before each burn remove debris and buildup to avoid excess smoke. Keep the wick centered in the container.</p>",
            "link_label": "Shop Wick Trimmers",
            "link": "#"
          }
        },
        "care_item_qt8gYU": {
          "type": "care_item",
          "disabled": true,
